The processed datasets under data/ are released under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International License (CC-BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

These datasets are derived from publicly available weekly COVID-19 sentinel
surveillance reports published by the Japanese Ministry of Health, Labour and
Welfare (MHLW). The derived/processed form distributed here adds value through
aggregation and normalisation; users must attribute both this work and the
original MHLW source, and should consult the MHLW terms of use for the
underlying reports.
